ed to rule on a preliminary injunction. A group of 12 states led by California sued the companies last week in an attempt to block the deal, which had been approved by the Trump administration . The states say the merger will eliminate competition by combining two of the five major Hollywood movie studios, and two of the five major owners of basic cable TV channels. Read full article Commentsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;01OegeocR62B3bAD-7ydG8x14lp07-dqacxZRf-DwiAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;AaZM53YLe-mi6CtjoKv7dNsVJu-bCyydwJjEm1qp3goƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pM2yHwE4IzHQUIJr0E7ZQ6FBDaTsIY9i1TT2lMUuZrIƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-wh-X3y3P6xwHValVbB0eWvNTmbUH8c9y0MrsDZmxgcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-QQhjI-BJxKisWcndTzOTyAGcrS8dpfqrR-o3ANbtCAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;v_fu38yjHzH4HAtHaVl1MUNPmiW8RHaxCUbBW3JlcC8ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nac-nc2aNAxsPXlQ5LHySypbvNsHLt77SdVsoM6xTKQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5_A7nSoVJPJblnTW_xeMjNgX6_YjHbJ5NnAPpXoZxocƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;An__PS62xBaDkSdQRGmuDeHDzWnRP14137LfRo4jYFIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒd